WEBVTT

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:06.780
(HORN BLARING)

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.620
(GRUNTING, YELLS)

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:14.740
(GRUNTING)

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:17.300
Vanellope!

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:24.460
(PANTING)

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:37.060
You know, you're acting
like a real bad guy here!

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.820
RALPHZILLA: No!

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:41.100
Well, you are!

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:43.380
And I will never
be your friend!

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:46.540
-(ROARING)
-(SHRIEKING)

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.100
RALPH: Hey, doofus!

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:50.820
Ralph!

00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:00.980
Catch me if you can,
you big dummy!

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:03.540
(RALPH GRUNTS)

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:08.780
I got you, little sister.

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.300
(VANELLOPE EXCLAIMS)

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:13.860
(GRUNTS) Now go!
Get out of here!

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:15.740
-Ralph!
-Go!

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:18.700
No! (STUTTERS) Don't hurt him!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:20.460
Please, no!

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:24.540
(GROANING)

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:27.620
Stop it! You're squishing him!

00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:29.180
(GROANING)

00:01:29.260 --> 00:01:31.380
You're gonna
kill my best friend!

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:32.940
(GROANING)

00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:34.500
(RALPH WHIMPERING)

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:38.140
Fine! You win! You win, okay?

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:40.780
(GASPING)

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:43.740
Just please put him down.

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:48.740
I'll be your only friend,
okay?

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:50.700
Just let him go.

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:52.580
No! No, kid.

00:01:53.740 --> 00:01:54.940
RALPHZILLA: Huh?

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:58.460
VANELLOPE:
That's it. That's it. Yeah.

00:01:58.620 --> 00:02:01.140
Put him down
and I'll go with you...

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:02.940
and we'll be
best friends forever.

00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:04.300
(EXCLAIMS)

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:05.820
Just me and you.

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:07.700
That's what you want, right?

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:10.900
(RALPHZILLA EXCLAIMING)

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:12.260
RALPH: Well,
that's not what I want!

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:16.420
It's not right to hold a
friend back from her dreams!

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:18.380
You don't own her!

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:21.340
That's not how
friendship works!

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:23.420
You need to let her go!

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:25.460
(RALPHZILLA SIGHING)

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:26.540
Hey.

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:31.860
You need to let her go.

00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:34.020
(RALPHZILLA EXCLAIMING SADLY)

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:37.940
I know. It's gonna hurt
a little bit when you do.

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:41.860
Oh, who am I kidding?
It's gonna hurt a lot.

00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:45.740
But you're gonna be okay.

00:02:48.220 --> 00:02:50.140
And we're gonna be okay.

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:51.380
Right, kid?

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:55.700
Of course we are. Always.

00:02:57.820 --> 00:03:00.740
See? No matter
where she goes...

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:03.100
or where she lives...

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:05.900
she's always gonna
be our friend.

00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:07.700
And we just gotta trust her.

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:11.100
Because that's what
best friends do.

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:13.500
Right?

00:03:17.820 --> 00:03:19.100
(RALPHZILLA SIGHS)

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:29.420
Thanks, buddy.

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:33.020
Wow! (CHUCKLES)

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:36.140
I feel good about this.

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:37.860
RALPHZILLA: Mmm.

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:40.780
RALPH CLONES: Mmm.

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:43.820
VANELLOPE: Ralph, look!

00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:46.100
I think you fixed
your insecurity!

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:49.060
(LAUGHS) You're right.

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:51.420
Whoo-hoo! (SCREAMING)

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:52.580
Ralph, no!

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:54.580
-(EXCLAIMING)
-(HORN BLARING)

00:03:54.660 --> 00:03:56.060
Whoa!

00:03:56.140 --> 00:03:58.060
Park it right here, Ralph!

00:03:58.140 --> 00:04:00.260
Your ol' pal
JP Spamley's gotcha!

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:02.660
(GASPS, LAUGHS) Whoo!

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:05.180
Wow, that didn't work.

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:07.700
(GROANS)

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:11.220
RAPUNZEL:
(GASPS) Look up there!

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:13.460
It's a big strong man
in need of rescuing.

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:15.420
(GRUNTS)

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:23.100
Hah!

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:30.500
(BIRDS CHIRPING)

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:32.220
(MICE CHATTERING)

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:34.060
(GIGGLING)

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:35.940
(CHITTERING)

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:40.020
-(GRUNTS)
-(GASPS)

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:41.540
(GRUNTS)

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:48.100
(BOTH GASP)

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:51.940
(VOCALIZING)

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:55.260
(WIND WHOOSHING)

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:03.140
(GROANS)

00:05:11.940 --> 00:05:13.980
-(KISSING SOUND)
-RALPH: Mmm.

00:05:16.020 --> 00:05:17.940
(GASPS) Oh, thanks, Frogger.

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:19.620
Wait a minute.

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:21.260
Who are all of you?

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:23.460
We're friends of Vanellope's.

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:25.900
Yeah, and any friend
of Vanellope's

00:05:25.980 --> 00:05:27.460
is a friend of ours.

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:29.140
You're welcome.

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:30.540
VANELLOPE: Ralph!

00:05:30.860 --> 00:05:32.780
Looking good, big fella!
(LAUGHS)

00:05:32.980 --> 00:05:34.340
-Heyo!
-(FABRIC RIPS)

00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:35.420
(PRINCESSES EXCLAIM)

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:36.620
This dress is not made
for a big boy.

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:38.780
It's going right up
the back alley there.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:40.300
Let me just make
a little adjustment.

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:42.620
-(TEARS FABRIC)
-There we go. (CHUCKLES)

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:44.340
NEWS ANCHOR:
Internet users are breathing

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:46.540
a collective sigh
of relief tonight.

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:49.180
Just as mysteriously
as it appeared,

00:05:49.260 --> 00:05:51.660
the Wreck-It Ralph virus
has vanished.

